# Fluxo completo do sistema, pelo gateway.
# Abra no VS Code com a extensão "REST Client" (humao.rest-client) e clique em "Send Request"
# em cada bloco, de cima para baixo. O token do login é reaproveitado nas chamadas seguintes.

@gateway = http://localhost:8080
@email = ana@insper.edu.br
@password = 123456

### Health-check (rotas abertas)
GET {{gateway}}/auth/health-check

###
GET {{gateway}}/accounts/health-check

### 1. Registrar usuário (aberta) -> 201 | 409 se o email já existe
POST {{gateway}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ana",
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### 2. Login (aberta) -> 200 {"jwt": "..."} | 401
# @name login
POST {{gateway}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### 3. Rota protegida SEM token -> 401
GET {{gateway}}/accounts

### 4. Rota protegida COM token -> 200
GET {{gateway}}/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.jwt}}

### 5. Token inválido -> 401
GET {{gateway}}/accounts
Authorization: Bearer token-invalido

### 6. Login com senha errada -> 401
POST {{gateway}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "senha-errada"
}
